OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry
OL,6,Finitially this evening, but cloud and
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain will spread
OL,8,Fsoutheastwards, perhaps turning heavy
OL,9,Fover higher ground. Rather humid but
OL,10,Fdrier and clearer from the north
OL,11,Ftowards dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAny lingering rain quickly
OL,14,Fclearing, with bright or sunny spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping throughout the morning.
OL,16,FTurning cloudier in the afternoon with
OL,17,Frain arriving. Feeling fresher with
OL,18,Ftemperatures nearer to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
