OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FSunshine and showers on Tuesday,
OL,7,Falthough showers easing later. Mostly
OL,8,Ffine and dry Wednesday and initially
OL,9,FThursday, before some patchy rain
OL,10,Farrives later. Feeling a little cool
OL,11,Ffor early September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
